### Challenges module — colección de requests (IntelliJ HTTP Client / VS Code REST Client)
### Base URL y token como variables. Corré primero el login del módulo users para
### obtener un token y pegalo en @token. Ajustá los ids según tus datos de prueba.

@host = http://localhost:8080
@token = PEGAR_TOKEN_ACA
@challengeId = 1
@submissionId = 1
@producerId = 2

### --- users (extensión del pivot): verificar un productor (solo admin) ---
PUT {{host}}/api/producers/{{producerId}}/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### --- Crear un challenge (solo admin). guestArtistId debe ser rol ARTIST ---
POST {{host}}/api/challenges
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Creamos el próximo hit de RKT",
  "genre": "RKT",
  "bpm": 100,
  "key": "F#m",
  "theme": "libre",
  "deadline": "2026-12-31T23:59:00Z",
  "guestArtistId": 3,
  "prizeFirst": "$100 USD + sesión de estudio",
  "prizeSecond": "Verificación de cuenta",
  "prizeThird": "Badge exclusivo"
}

### --- Listar challenges ---
GET {{host}}/api/challenges

### --- Detalle de un challenge ---
GET {{host}}/api/challenges/{{challengeId}}

### --- Enviar una submission (solo PRODUCER, antes del deadline) ---
POST {{host}}/api/challenges/{{challengeId}}/submissions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "audioUrl": "https://soundcloud.com/example/mi-produccion"
}

### --- Listar submissions de un challenge ---
GET {{host}}/api/challenges/{{challengeId}}/submissions

### --- Votar una submission (1–10, comentario opcional; un voto por usuario) ---
POST {{host}}/api/submissions/{{submissionId}}/votes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "score": 9,
  "comment": "Muy buena la melodía"
}

### --- Cerrar el challenge: calcula puntajes y crea el top 3 (solo admin) ---
PUT {{host}}/api/challenges/{{challengeId}}/close
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### --- Opportunity pick del artista invitado (solo el guestArtist) ---
PUT {{host}}/api/challenges/{{challengeId}}/opportunity-pick?submissionId={{submissionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### --- Histórico de resultados (filtro opcional por producerId) ---
GET {{host}}/api/challenges/results?producerId={{producerId}}

### --- Ranking global (suma de puntos por productor, desc) ---
GET {{host}}/api/ranking
